  "description": "An SMB 2/3 file server in pure C# (dialects 2.0.2 to 3.0.2, NTLMv2 or guest, signing, compounding, Apple's macOS extensions) that serves shares from any file system you implement, or a local folder. No admin rights: listen on any port.",
